EXTRA={'Choose your language / 26':'Выбери язык / 26','X: select and save  O: calculator':'X: выбрать и сохранить  O: калькулятор','Arrows: select  X/START: save language':'Стрелки: выбор  X/START: сохранить язык','Language is saved in config.json':'Язык сохраняется в config.json','Language save failed: check assets and memory card':'Язык не сохранён: проверь assets и карту памяти','Language / 26 languages':'Язык / 26 языков'}
def main():
 root=ROOT/'assets/locale';source=json.loads((root/'source.json').read_text());source.update(EXTRA)
 (root/'source.json').write_text(json.dumps(source,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
 for line in ROWS.splitlines():
  lang,row=line.split(':',1);values=row.split('|');assert len(values)==len(KEYS),(lang,len(values))
  p=root/(lang+'.json');data=json.loads(p.read_text());data.update(dict(zip(KEYS,values)))
  # Derive repeated labels from the same reviewed names.
  for key,base in [('Three graphs / table','Graph / table'),('CalcAero Laboratory','Laboratory'),('Matrix editor A / B','Matrices A / B'),('Tools: equations / integrals','Tools'),('Textbook formula: full screen','Formula / 2D')]:
   if base in data and base in KEYS:data[key]=data[base]
  # New controls are filled by the bulk translator separately.
  for key in EXTRA:data.setdefault(key,key)
  p.write_text(json.dumps(data,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
 (root/'ru.json').write_text(json.dumps(source,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
 from opencc import OpenCC
 cc=OpenCC('s2twp');data=json.loads((root/'zh-CN.json').read_text());(root/'zh-TW.json').write_text(json.dumps({k:cc.convert(v) for k,v in data.items()},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
if __name__=='__main__':main()
